WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.170
GENERAL HURTLING, PUTIN NOW
SAYS HE HAS NO DOUBT RUSSIA'S

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:09.943
GOALS WILL BE ACHIEVED AND SAYS
IT AS ZELENSKY IS IN

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:12.445
WASHINGTON.
SERGEI SHOIGU OF RUSSIA HAS ANNOUNCED A

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:16.616
MASSIVE INCREASE IN THE SIZE OF
THE RUSSIAN MILITARY FROM 1 TO

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:21.654
1.5 MILLION PERSONNEL.
OBVIOUSLY 100,000 OF THEM OR SO

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.791
WERE ALREADY DEAD IN UKRAINE,
BUT THEY'RE ANNOUNCING A MASS

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.092
INCREASE.
IS THIS REAL?

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:29.329
COULD THIS REALLY HAPPEN OR IS
IT TOTAL BLUSTER?

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:36.736
WHAT DO YOU THINK, GENERAL?
&gt;&gt; I THINK A LOT OF IT'S

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.404
BLUSTER.
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, THE POINT IS MR.

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.541
PUTIN CONTINUES TO ANNOUNCE WHAT
HE'S GOING TO DO IN TERMS OF

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:45.445
MOBILIZATION OF FORCES.
IN LAS VEGAS, ERIN, THIS IS

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:48.348
CALLED THROWING GOOD MONEY AFTER
BAD.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:53.720
HE JUST CONTINUES TO ATTEMPT TO
MOBILIZE FORCES.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:58.625
HE'S SEEN A GREAT RANGE WITHIN
RUSSIA ITSELF OF YOUNG 18 TO

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:01.161
24-YEAR-OLDS LEAVING THE COUNTRY
TRYING TO DEPART TO AVOID THIS

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:04.664
KIND OF STUFF.
HE HAS PROVEN DECIDEDLY THAT HE

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.800
DOES NOT HAVE THE EQUIPMENT.
THERE'S NO DOCTRINE THAT THE

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.469
SOLDIERS ARE FOLLOWING THAT'S
EFFECTIVE.

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:16.676
THEIR LEADERS ARE CORRUPT AND
IMMORAL, AND THEY ARE NOT --

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:19.679
THEY'RE ACTUALLY CONTRIBUTING TO
THE FAILURE AS OPPOSED TO

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:23.783
PREVENTING IT.
THERE'S A LACK OF ABILITY TO

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:26.286
ADAPT TO THE BATTLEFIELD
CONDITIONS, AND THE FINAL

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:30.256
THOUGHT IS ANY MODERN ARMY THAT
PERFORMS WELL ON THE BATTLEFIELD

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:33.526
HAS TRUST IN THEIR LEADERS,
THEIR EQUIPMENT, THEIR DOCTRINE,

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:38.364
AND THE SUPPORT OF THE PEOPLE.
THE RUSSIAN SOLDIERS DO NOT HAVE

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:41.301
THAT, SO IT DOESN'T MATTER HOW
MANY HE'S MOBILIZING.

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:45.705
IT JUST MEANS THAT MORE OF THEM
ARE GOING TO DIE ON THE

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.707
BATTLEFIELD.
&gt;&gt; SO ANDRE, YOU KNOW, THE

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:50.443
GENERAL TALKS ABOUT TRUST.
WE REALIZE IT DOES NOT EXIST IN

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:55.949
MANY CASES BETWEEN THE RUSSIAN
SOLDIERS THEMSELVES, BETWEEN

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:57.650
ONES WHO ARE ALREADY THERE AND
NEW CONSCRIPTS AND MANY OF THEM

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.820
AND THEIR COMMANDERS.
THAT LATEST INTERCEPTED PHONE

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:04.424
CALL -- AND I KNOW YOU AND I
HAVE TALKED ABOUT SO MANY OF

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.626
THESE.
BUT THE ONE WE JUST HEARD ABOUT

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:10.296
PEOPLE PULLING A 500 AND F-BOMB
AND I'M NOT FIGHTING ANYMORE,

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:13.899
I'M JUST WALKING OFF, THIS IS IN
LINE WITH SO MANY CALLS AND

00:02:13.899 --> 00:02:16.869
VIDEOS THAT WE HAVE HEARD AND
SEEN THAT SHOW A DIRE SITUATION

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:24.844
AMONG THE RUSSIAN TROOPS.
MAJOR EQUIPMENT ISSUES PUTIN

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:32.485
KNOWS ABOUT ALL THIS.
DOES HE ANDRE, OR IS HE IN THE

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:35.288
DARK?
WHAT'S THE REALITY?

00:02:35.288 --> 00:02:37.890
&gt;&gt; TODAY WHEN HE DECIDED TO HIS
MILITARY COMMANDERS HE LOOKED TO

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:43.396
BE DELUSIONAL.
IT LOOKS LIKE HE STILL BELIEVES

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:47.667
HE'S IN TOTAL CONTROL OF THE
WHOLE SITUATION.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:51.604
HE CONSTANTLY WAS TALKING ABOUT
THE NEW OBJECTIVES FOR THE WAR,

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:54.841
THAT WE HAVE THIS CONFLICT FOR
CENTURIES, WE'RE GOING TO WIN,

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:58.511
WE'RE GOING TO INCREASE OUR
ARMY.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:12.692
AND BECAUSE OF THE UNREST -- AND
THE PROBLEM IS SOME KIND OF

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:17.229
DISSENT HE HAD IN PUBLIC
OPINION, IN RUSSIAN SOCIAL MEDIA

00:03:17.229 --> 00:03:19.932
ARE SUPPRESSED BY THE KREMLIN
AND RUSSIAN SECURITY SERVICES.

00:03:19.932 --> 00:03:24.036
SO THE ONLY PICTURE WE CAN
ACTUALLY SEE IS COMPLETE

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:27.440
OBEDIENCE, AND THAT IS WHY HE
STILL BELIEVES THAT HE IS IN

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.909
CONTROL.
&gt;&gt; GENERAL, TODAY PUTIN SAID,

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:34.146
QUOTE, WE NEED TO CONTINUE TO
SUPPORT AND IMPROVE THE

00:03:34.146 --> 00:03:37.450
READINESS OF RUSSIA'S NUCLEAR
WEAPONS.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.852
WHAT DO YOU THINK PUTIN'S NEXT
MOVE WILL BE HERE.

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:42.522
HE'S BEEN SO CLEAR THERE WILL BE
ONE IN RESPONSE TO THE PATRIOT,

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:46.759
SO WHAT DOES HE DO?
&gt;&gt; WELL, HE -- HE'S NOT GOING TO

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:50.296
HAVE MUCH OF AN EFFECT ON THE
PATRIOTS TO BE HONEST WITH YOU,

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:51.997
ERIN.
AS YOU TALKED TO SOME OF YOUR

00:03:51.997 --> 00:03:55.835
LAST GUESTS ABOUT THE SIZE OF
THAT FORCE, THAT'S A RELATIVELY

00:03:55.835 --> 00:03:59.105
SMALL BATTERY THAT'S GOING TO
HAVE PROBABLY SIX LAUNCHERS

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:02.108
AROUND UKRAINE -- I'M SORRY,
AROUND KYIV.

00:04:02.108 --> 00:04:05.678
THEY'RE GOING TO BE HEAVILY
GUARDED, AND HE DOESN'T HAVE THE

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:08.715
CAPABILITY TO ATTACK THEM.
WHAT WE'VE SEEN MR. PUTIN AND

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:12.018
HIS MILITARY DO IS ATTACK MORE
OF THE CIVILIAN POPULATION THAN

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:16.756
HE HAS UKRAINE'S MILITARY.
SO, YOU KNOW, THE COMMENT ABOUT

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:20.593
CONTINUING TO POLISH HIS NUCLEAR
CAPABILITY IS SOMETHING THAT

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:23.830
HE'S BEEN SAYING AND THREATENING
SINCE THE BEGINNING OF THIS WAR.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:33.573
AND HE HAS MADE A LOT OF BAD
MISTAKES BOTH OPERATIONALLY,

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:36.609
TACTICALLY AND STRATEGICALLY.
THIS WOULD BE A HUGE MISSTEP ON

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:39.812
HIS PART.
AND I THINK HE KNOWS THE

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:43.049
REPERCUSSIONS FOR THE USE OF ANY
KIND OF NUCLEAR WEAPONS WOULD BE

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:47.052
CATASTROPHIC BECAUSE THAT'S WHAT
PRESIDENT BIDEN AND OTHERS

00:04:47.052 --> 00:04:52.091
WITHIN THE ADMINISTRATION HAS
TOLD HIM AND HIS ADMINISTRATION.

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:53.993
SO THIS IS JUST MORE THREATS,
MORE BLUSTER BY MR. PUTIN.

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:57.897
AND I SURE HOME HIS NUCLEAR
FORCE IS A LOT BETTER THAN HIS

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:00.867
CONVENTIONAL FORCE BECAUSE HIS
CONVENTIONAL FORCE HAS NOT SHOWN

00:05:00.867 --> 00:05:05.738
ANY CAPABILITY WHATSOEVER.
&gt;&gt; THANKS TO BOTH OF YOU THIS

00:05:05.738 --> 00:05:06.706
EVENING.

